{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OyQ75kEJKV1795269478.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳門大賽車格蘭披治電單車賽，英國的赫爾文刷新賽道紀錄，第五次封王。</p><p></p><p>赫爾文駕駛88號戰車，排頭位起步。12圈賽事，不夠1圈就有意外，大會出示紅旗。第三位起步的特倫默失平衡倒地，這位奧地利車手自行上救護車。</p><p></p><p>近25分鐘後賽事重開，赫爾文繼續帶出，慢慢拋離車群，鬥完2圈已經進入無人之境。這位39歲英國車手過去四次奪冠，今次不止贏，趕過隊尾車手，更憑第7圈造出的2分22秒697，刷新塵封16年的賽道紀錄，超過38秒優勢封王，第四次奪冠。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:37:29.389824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:11.313043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:30:52.466250+00:00","content_hash":"2b1f6dafa89651e5ecd16246af68f0e3aba8ef5a98a79b62e744561a1310bad7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:37:29.389824+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}